* Hardware: "The Hardware team develops efficiently scalable models and training techniques, and does pathfinding research to accelerate the development of next-gen AI hardware." [http://webcache.googleusercontent.com/search?q=cache:WxgzREJyPTkJ:https://openai.com/jobs/&hl=en&gl=us&strip=0&vwsrc=1]
